
"smart_sources:2026-04-23 - In wake of stabbing suit, Boise County seeks help investigating alleged commissioner misconduct, incl. public fund misuse.md": {"path":"2026-04-23 - In wake of stabbing suit, Boise County seeks help investigating alleged commissioner misconduct, incl. public fund misuse.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"k24cq3","at":1785795032311},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1783531096796,"size":4008,"at":1785795032542,"hash":"k24cq3"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,32]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Julie Luchetta","target":"Julie Luchetta","line":5},{"title":"A seal of Boise County is at the center of the image, with a collage of pictures depicting sites from the area, including a log cabin, the county courthouse, a snowy river, a sunset sky, an bird's eye view of the Payette River and a historical red train","target":"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/174170d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/967x644+0+0/resize/1760x1172!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F86%2F4b%2Fdc05d55c4e6589b8b01c28a2cd28%2Fboise-county.jpg","line":10,"embedded":true},{"title":"accusing Boise County Commissioner Darrell “Lindy” Lindstrom of stabbing a minor last summer during a riverside altercation","target":"https://www.boisestatepublicradio.org/law-justice/2026-04-16/boise-county-commissioner-assault-sheriff-payette-river-lawsuit-linstrom","line":16}],"metadata":{"title":"In wake of stabbing suit, Boise County seeks help investigating alleged commissioner misconduct, incl. public fund misuse","source":"https://www.boisestatepublicradio.org/news/2026-04-23/lindstrom-attorney-general-public-officials-allegations","author":["[[Julie Luchetta]]"],"published":"2026-04-23","created":"2026-07-08","description":"Boise County is asking the state attorney general for help in investigating allegations against its own officials. The accusations include interfering in a law enforcement investigation, violating open meeting laws, electioneering and misuse of public funds."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},